    "detailed_description": "Is the mist playing with your eyes, or do you really see before you... a girl with a scorpion tail?<br />\r\n<br />\r\nRuneflame is a top-down adventure puzzle RPG featuring archery that places you in a world of riddle magic and tangled conflicts between people and spirits.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nCreate a unique character from one of four fantasy races and begin to uncover the mysteries of this strange place. To make your way out of the fog, you must hone your skill with the bow and solve the puzzles that keep you trapped. And beyond the walls of your prison, what else will you discover?<br />\r\n<br />\r\nEach adventure is a standalone module that your character can explore, and new modules for individual purchase will continually be added to expand the world. There are no other items to purchase in the game, only secrets for you to unearth with curiosity and logic.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nRuneflame - a role-playing fantasy adventure game in the vein of old-school point-and-click adventures and computer RPGs.",
    "about_the_game": "Is the mist playing with your eyes, or do you really see before you... a girl with a scorpion tail?<br />\r\n<br />\r\nRuneflame is a top-down adventure puzzle RPG featuring archery that places you in a world of riddle magic and tangled conflicts between people and spirits.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nCreate a unique character from one of four fantasy races and begin to uncover the mysteries of this strange place. To make your way out of the fog, you must hone your skill with the bow and solve the puzzles that keep you trapped. And beyond the walls of your prison, what else will you discover?<br />\r\n<br />\r\nEach adventure is a standalone module that your character can explore, and new modules for individual purchase will continually be added to expand the world. There are no other items to purchase in the game, only secrets for you to unearth with curiosity and logic.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nRuneflame - a role-playing fantasy adventure game in the vein of old-school point-and-click adventures and computer RPGs.",
    "short_description": "Runeflame is a point-and-click fantasy adventure with an open world and an emphasis on puzzle-solving. Guide your custom character through the immersive world of Runeflame, where secrets and magic have minds of their own.",
